"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A ninja obsessed with technology, wielding a kendama-shaped flash drive filled with deadly spam. Completely unbound by anyone, they quickly leap to avoid danger.","abilities":["Briefly takes off when colliding with <'Certain Fates'>, blocked, or encountering a Hole."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":7000,"atk":350,"def":100,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"doton_master":{"slug":"doton_master","name":"Doton Master","icon":"/enemies-icons/Doton Master.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A professional ninja who has carefully studied the texture and scent of the soil to improve his disguise. Still not that much harder to detect, despite his efforts.","abilities":["When on the battlefield, has Invisibility and disguises as a Hole","Becomes hostile after losing Invisibility or absorbing <'Certain Fates'>","Permanently loses Invisibility when becoming hostile"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":500,"def":250,"res":70,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"suiton_master":{"slug":"suiton_master","name":"Suiton Master","icon":"/enemies-icons/Suiton Master.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A ninja that attacks by spinning in place. Claims that creating a vortex from air is a type of suiton too, even without water around him. Nobody wants to go out with him because he refuses to walk properly.","abilities":["Deals Physical damage to surroundings while spinning, and stops spinning when shifted","Bounces <'Certain Fates'>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":750,"def":550,"res